{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Long time no talk - hope you're doing well. Guess what? Last week I actually won an online gaming tournament! It was such an exciting experience and it blew my mind when I won. Winning felt so good and it really motivated me to keep improving."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-14734d7a07a796e81253220e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:08.653744+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "14734d7a07a796e81253220e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "14734d7a07a796e81253220e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James! Congrats on winning the online gaming tournament! It's super fulfilling to see your hard work pay off. So happy for you!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-864c4f4865ae99ad00b3bd44", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:12.761811+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "864c4f4865ae99ad00b3bd44", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "864c4f4865ae99ad00b3bd44", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks! It was really fulfilling to see my hard work pay off with a victory in the tournament. How are you?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-ed90244ff8e8382158f34639", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:16.836675+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ed90244ff8e8382158f34639", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ed90244ff8e8382158f34639", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Feeling the tug of emotion lately. Determined and passionate on one hand, but feeling overwhelmed and stressed on the other. Balancing personal and professional is kind of a challenge. How have you been?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-af0d2553eadbda6a0393b856", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:20.974571+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af0d2553eadbda6a0393b856", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af0d2553eadbda6a0393b856", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yeah, staying balanced can be tough. I'm trying to take breaks from my hobbies and do other things. Lately I've become interested in extreme sports. Yesterday, for example, I was doing rope jumping. The highest height I jumped from was 150 meters!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-f2ea8316a2e3cdecf8363726", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:25.136972+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f2ea8316a2e3cdecf8363726", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f2ea8316a2e3cdecf8363726", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, how cool! What other extreme sport have you tried?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-3b01b1d918ca8af683895230", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:29.261786+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3b01b1d918ca8af683895230", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3b01b1d918ca8af683895230", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Just three days ago, I was surfing. Catching a wave is so cool! It's strange, but it relaxes me so much. How do you like to relax?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-02d664616a24c5f2ebe60f40", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:33.384540+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "02d664616a24c5f2ebe60f40", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "02d664616a24c5f2ebe60f40", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I like to relax by reading. I love entering the imaginative worlds of authors - it's a fun escape from reality."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-5e471557e3426c885a9378a3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:37.503453+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e471557e3426c885a9378a3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e471557e3426c885a9378a3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I also love to read, especially while snuggled under the covers on a cold winter day. But now it\u2019s summer and I want something more exciting! By the way, I bought air tickets to Toronto, and I\u2019m leaving the day after tomorrow evening."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-5623d4660242eb0a08a5a88a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:41.631569+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5623d4660242eb0a08a5a88a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5623d4660242eb0a08a5a88a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool, this is already the fourth country you will visit! Will you only be in Toronto, or will you be visiting somewhere else?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-c270878423c6e0f72041aba7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:45.783026+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c270878423c6e0f72041aba7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c270878423c6e0f72041aba7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I also plan to visit Vancouver. Maybe, I'll go somewhere else."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-b3d3f61ba56f549efcdca302", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:49.947189+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b3d3f61ba56f549efcdca302", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b3d3f61ba56f549efcdca302", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: When are you coming back?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-bd88d924c75cfb97db44f7b1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:54.094704+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd88d924c75cfb97db44f7b1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd88d924c75cfb97db44f7b1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I plan to return on July 20, I\u2019ll definitely bring you some kind of souvenir!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-46f14c470516a8f4d64b276b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:27:58.213435+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "46f14c470516a8f4d64b276b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "46f14c470516a8f4d64b276b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks James! I will be waiting for you from your journey! Bon Voyage!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-f43e09eac281044226e49d87", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:28:02.364218+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f43e09eac281044226e49d87", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f43e09eac281044226e49d87", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thank you, John! Take care and see you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-13fcaa394d2621695042149b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:28:06.497994+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "13fcaa394d2621695042149b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "13fcaa394d2621695042149b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Take care, bye!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-47/session_16-46f48218f5d4e851d93c6bd7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T10:28:10.614538+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "46f48218f5d4e851d93c6bd7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "46f48218f5d4e851d93c6bd7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
